  {
    num: "7778"
    title: "Recipe"
    description: "A cooking recipe with ingredients and steps."
    shapeIndex: 3
    mamlText: "{\n  title: \"Celery Salad\"\n  servings: 7\n  prep_time: \"49 minutes\"\n  cook_time: \"84 minutes\"\n\n  # Ingredients\n  ingredients: [\n    \"3 cups wasabi\"\n    \"3 lbs yellow papaw\"\n    \"3 lbs flat mushrooms\"\n    \"4 pieces monkfish\"\n    \"1 pieces tamari\"\n  ]\n\n  # Instructions\n  steps: [\n    \"A heartwarming Nepalese soup, featuring fresh asafoetida and an aromatic blend of traditional spices.\"\n    \"Crispy fried quail bites, seasoned with turmeric and served with a tangy mangosteen dipping sauce.\"\n    \"A delightful tart combining fresh bok choy and sweet papaya, set in a buttery pastry shell and finished with a hint of china star.\"\n    \"A slow-roasted Labrador Duck with a zesty, delicious exterior. Stuffed with pear and covered in bush tomato sauce. Sides with onion puree and wild carrot.\"\n    \"A classic pie filled with delicious salmon and rich hummus, baked in a sweet pastry crust and topped with a golden-brown lattice.\"\n    \"Hearty butter beans and turkey stew, slow-cooked with garlic and okra for a comforting, flavorful meal.\"\n    \"Savor the rich flavors of sour kohlrabi, complemented by dried apricot and aniseed.\"\n  ]\n\n  nutrition: {\n    calories: 512\n    protein: \"29g\"\n    carbs: \"86g\"\n    fat: \"23g\"\n  }\n}"
  }
